<title>USA: Bloomfield SD 6, N.M., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Bloomfield SD 6, N.M., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $4 million of Bloomfield SD 6, N.M., general obligation school building bonds, Series March 1, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.68 percent.</p>
</text>
